<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Roadster Highway Privacy Policy</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --bg: #faf9f7;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --ink: #131110;
    --ink-soft: #57504d;
    --muted: #8a817d;
    --border: #e7e2dd;
    --accent: #ff2a30;
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
    --rule: #131110;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --bg: #0b0d12;
      --surface: #12151c;
      --ink: #f2f3f6;
      --ink-soft: #c9ced8;
      --muted: #9aa3b2;
      --border: #2a2f3a;
      --accent: #ff2a30;
      --accent-ink: #ffffff;
      --rule: #ff2a30;
    

    }
  }

  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg: #0b0d12;
    --surface: #12151c;
    --ink: #f2f3f6;
    --ink-soft: #c9ced8;
    --muted: #9aa3b2;
    --border: #2a2f3a;
    --accent: #ff2a30;
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
    --rule: #ff2a30;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  body {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  img { max-width: 100%; }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 96px;
  }

  header.masthead {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .glyph {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #131110;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }
  .glyph svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }

  .masthead-text .brand {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .masthead-text .doc-kind {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }

  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    padding-left: 14px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rule);
  }

  p, li {
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  p { margin: 0 0 14px; }

  ul { margin: 0 0 14px; padding-left: 22px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

  a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }

  .card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px 26px;
  }

  .contact {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 26px;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .contact .label {
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .contact .value {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
        <path d="M3 15.5c0-1.2.7-2 1.9-2.3l2.6-.6 2.2-2.4c.5-.5 1.1-.8 1.8-.8h3.7c.8 0 1.5.4 2 1l1.7 2.2 1.4.4c.8.2 1.2.9 1.2 1.7v.8c0 .6-.5 1.1-1.1 1.1H4.1c-.6 0-1.1-.5-1.1-1.1z" fill="#ff2a30"/>
        <circle cx="7.5" cy="17" r="1.8" fill="#131110" stroke="#ff2a30" stroke-width="1.4"/>
        <circle cx="16.5" cy="17" r="1.8" fill="#131110" stroke="#ff2a30" stroke-width="1.4"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="masthead-text">
      <div class="brand">Roadster Highway</div>
      <div class="doc-kind">Legal · Privacy</div>
    </div>
  </header>


  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="updated">Last updated October&nbsp;22, 2026</div>

  <p class="lede">Roadster Highway is an endless highway racing game. This page explains, in plain terms, what data the app touches and the choices you have over it.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Who runs this app</h2>
    <p>Roadster Highway ("the app") is developed and published by <strong>Muhammad Faiz</strong> under the name <strong>GAMEFAI</strong> ("we", "us"). The app does not require an account, a sign-up, or any personal profile to play.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What the app collects directly</h2>
    <p>Nothing personal. Your coins, unlocked Roadster upgrades, best distances and settings (sound, camera) are saved <strong>only on your device</strong>, using Android's standard local app storage. We do not run our own servers and never see this data. Uninstalling the app removes it.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Advertising, via Google AdMob</h2>
    <p>The app is supported by ads served through <strong>Google AdMob</strong> — interstitial and rewarded formats. Rewarded ads are always optional: you choose to watch them to continue a run, get a rocket boost or earn extra coins. To serve and measure these ads, Google and its advertising partners may process:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your device's advertising identifier</li>
      <li>Approximate location, derived from IP address</li>
      <li>Ad interaction data — impressions, clicks, and watch-through</li>
      <li>Basic device and app information, and diagnostics from the ads SDK</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This is handled entirely by Google under its own <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a> and its <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">partner sites disclosure</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your consent choice</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p style="margin-bottom:0">Where required by law — including for players in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland — the app asks for your consent before showing personalized ads, using Google's User Messaging Platform. You can review or change that choice at any time from <strong>Settings → Privacy Settings</strong> on the app's home screen.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>Roadster Highway is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Opt out of personalized ads any time via <strong>Privacy Settings</strong> in the app, or through your device's Google Settings → Ads.</li>
      <li>Reset your device's advertising identifier from Android Settings whenever you like.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="contact">
    <div>
      <div class="label">Questions about this policy</div>
      <div class="value">itsfaiz80@gmail.com</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="label">App</div>
      <div class="value">Roadster Highway</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>© 2026 Muhammad Faiz. This policy may be updated as the app evolves.</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
